# CR 106.3a: a Snow-Covered Plains produces snow white, not plain white --
# TapLandForMana reads the land's own Snow supertype, the same subtype-only
# mechanism the plain basic land ability already reads (manaability.go).
# Snow mana pays a snow ({S}) requirement no plain mana of that color can,
# which is what ChoosePaySnow (queue paysnow) exists to answer.
tapformana human 1 W
queue paysnow W
paymanacost human S
